OL,3,GNEWSAFree car parking offered in run-up
OL,4,Ato Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome council-owned car parks in South
OL,7,FKesteven will offer free parking in the
OL,8,Frun- up to Christmas.
OL,10,FThere will be no charges at the Wharf
OL,11,FRoad multi-storey in Grantham between
OL,12,F30 November and Christmas Eve.
OL,14,FStamford's Cattle Market car park will
OL,15,Fbe free from Monday to Thursday during
OL,16,Fthe same period, South Kesteven
OL,17,FDistrict Council said.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
