OL,3,GNEWSAFree car parking offered in run-up
OL,4,Ato Christmas
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Richard Cleaver said: "This
OL,7,Fwill make trips to our town centres
OL,8,Fmore affordable for residents and
OL,9,Fshoppers at this expensive time of year
OL,10,Fand also support our town centre
OL,11,Fretailers and hospitality venues."
